      }
    ],
    "observed_dialogue": [
      {
        "da_id": "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.147",
        "meeting_id": "TS3006b",
        "text": "So is it from sixteen to forty ? Is it from twenty to forty ? Is it from thirty ?",
        "participant": "MTD021PM",
        "role": "PM"
      },
      {
        "da_id": "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.174",
        "meeting_id": "TS3006b",
        "text": "Uh sixteen to forty .",
        "participant": "MTD024ME",
        "role": "ME"
      },
      {
        "da_id": "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.148",
        "meeting_id": "TS3006b",
        "text": "Yeah ? 'Kay .",
        "participant": "MTD021PM",
        "role": "PM"
      },
      {
        "da_id": "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.80",
        "meeting_id": "TS3006b",
        "text": "Or below <vocalsound>",
        "participant": "MTD024ME",
        "role": "ME"
      },
      {
        "da_id": "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.47",
        "meeting_id": "TS3006b",
        "text": "Yeah below forty .",
        "participant": "MTD021PM",
        "role": "PM"
      },
      {
        "da_id": "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.81",
        "meeting_id": "TS3006b",
        "text": "because that's pretty relevant .",
        "participant": "MTD024ME",
        "role": "ME"
      },
      {
        "da_id": "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.49",
        "meeting_id": "TS3006b",
        "text": "Our current customers are in the age group forty plus .",
        "participant": "MTD021PM",
        "role": "PM"
      },
      {
        "da_id": "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.83",
        "meeting_id": "TS3006b",
        "text": "Yeah ?",
        "participant": "MTD024ME",
        "role": "ME"
      },
      {
        "da_id": "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.50",
        "meeting_id": "TS3006b",
        "text": "And the new product should reach new markets , which is the customers below forty .",
        "participant": "MTD021PM",
        "role": "PM"
      },
      {
        "da_id": "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.90",
        "meeting_id": "TS3006b",
        "text": "Uh but below that age they uh they pretty much are .",
        "participant": "MTD024ME",
        "role": "ME"
      },
      {
        "da_id": "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.91",
        "meeting_id": "TS3006b",
        "text": "So I think we can build that in .",
        "participant": "MTD024ME",
        "role": "ME"
      },
      {
        "da_id": "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.173",
        "participant": "MTD024ME",
        "role": "ME",
        "text": "How do you mean ?"
      },
      {
        "da_id": "TS3006b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.98",
        "participant": "MTD023UID",
        "role": "UI",
        "text": "Yeah ."
      },
      {
        "da_id": "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.175",
        "participant": "MTD024ME",
        "role": "ME",
        "text": "Well I I guess people of sixteen are are quite used to technology ."
      },
      {
        "da_id": "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.79",
        "participant": "MTD024ME",
        "role": "ME",
        "text": "The new product ?"
      },
      {
        "da_id": "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.48",
        "participant": "MTD021PM",
        "role": "PM",
        "text": "Mm-hmm ."
      },
      {
        "da_id": "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.82",
        "participant": "MTD024ME",
        "role": "ME",
        "text": "I thought I read a <disfmarker>"
      },
      {
        "da_id": "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.84",
        "participant": "MTD024ME",
        "role": "ME",
        "text": "Below ?"
      },
      {
        "da_id": "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.89",
        "participant": "MTD024ME",
        "role": "ME",
        "text": "I mean uh above forty people are not so interested uh not so interested in a screen or speech recognition ."
      },
      {
        "da_id": "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.92",
        "participant": "MTD024ME",
        "role": "ME",
        "text": "Um <disfmarker>"
      }
    ],
    "peer_items": [
      {
        "item_key": "TS3006b#0",
        "type": "actions",
        "text": "The User Interface Designer can design a menu for all these functions."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "TS3006b#1",
        "type": "problems",
        "text": "The current look-and-feel and usability of remote controls are disliked by users and are hard to learn, with remotes often getting lost in rooms."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "TS3006b#2",
        "type": "problems",
        "text": "Open problem: it is unclear what the screen should do or what is required from it."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "TS3006b#3",
        "type": "problems",
        "text": "Uncertainty about saving the project file (whether it saves automatically and where)."
      }
    ],
